@startuml
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
  - studentId : String
  + bookRoom(room : Room, startTime : DateTime, durationMinutes : Integer) : Booking
  + cancelBooking(booking : Booking) : void
}

class Room {
  - roomId : String
  - name : String
  - blocked : Boolean
  + block() : void
  + unblock() : void
  + isBlocked() : Boolean
  + getAvailability(from : DateTime, to : DateTime) : List<TimeSlot>
}

class Booking {
  - bookingId : String
  - startTime : DateTime
  - durationMinutes : Integer
  - status : BookingStatus
  - confirmationId : String
  + /endTime : DateTime
  + isValidRequest(now : DateTime) : Boolean
  + overlapsWith(other : Booking) : Boolean
  + confirm() : String
  + cancel() : void
  + isActive() : Boolean
}

enum BookingStatus {
  ACTIVE
  CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : is reserved by >

note bottom of Booking
  R1: A new booking must start in the future.
      Duration must be > 0 and <= 120 minutes.
      endTime = startTime + durationMinutes.

  R2: ACTIVE bookings for the same room
      must not overlap.
      Two intervals overlap when:
      a.startTime < b.endTime and
      b.startTime < a.endTime.

  R3: A blocked room cannot accept new bookings.
      Check Room.blocked before creating a booking.

  R4: Every successful booking produces
      a confirmation; confirm() sets confirmationId.

  US-03: Only the booking's owner may cancel it.
      Cancellation changes status to CANCELLED.

  A1: One booking may start exactly when another ends.
  A2: Blocking a room preserves existing bookings.
end note

@enduml